        ? `Only ${n} data point(s) exist. Limits are mathematically valid (I-MR formulas require no minimum beyond n=2) but statistically low-confidence -- ${ASQ_CONFIDENCE_THRESHOLD - n} more scan(s) needed to reach the ~20-observation convention ASQ describes for trusting initial control limits.`
        : `Calculated from ${n} time-ordered scans -- meets the general ~20-observation convention for initial control-limit confidence.`,
